(6726598, 1006150, 16148, '<td valign="top">excellent!</td>', 'excellent!', '2012-03-30 01:08:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(6726607, 1007088, 114285, '<td valign="top">You peaked, how did you get it so sharp...lol</td>', 'You peaked, how did you get it so sharp...lol', '2012-03-30 01:13:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(6726613, 1005906, 114285, '<td valign="top">Gorgeous mood and light.</td>', 'Gorgeous mood and light.', '2012-03-30 01:17:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(6726616, 1006700, 117534, '<td valign="top">I believe this one.. Nice job</td>', 'I believe this one.. Nice job', '2012-03-30 01:18:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(6726617, 1006905, 117534, '<td valign="top">Think you stayed honest too... cool shot</td>', 'Think you stayed honest too... cool shot', '2012-03-30 01:19:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(6726619, 1007106, 117534, '<td valign="top">The only thing I can''t believe about this shot is that you didn''t get run over!!!! Nice Job, It looks like you stayed honest and have an intrestring shot as well!!</td>', 'The only thing I can''t believe about this shot is that you didn''t get run over!!!! Nice Job, It looks like you stayed honest and have an intrestring shot as well!!', '2012-03-30 01:20:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(6726620, 1006742, 114285, '<td valign="top">That is so effective.</td>', 'That is so effective.', '2012-03-30 01:22:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(6726623, 1006255, 117534, '<td valign="top">Cool this feels real, ie you were honest with the challenge, but it is a VERY interestring shot. Not sure what I''m looking at BUT it keeps me drawn in!! Great Job</td>', 'Cool this feels real, ie you were honest with the challenge, but it is a VERY interestring shot. Not sure what I''m looking at BUT it keeps me drawn in!! Great Job', '2012-03-30 01:22:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(6726625, 1007110, 37629, '<td valign="top">I feel like this suits the challenge and is the kind of photo I was expecting to see. The zoom effect fools with my eyes and I enjoyed it enough to comment on it however the content could be more interesting.</td>', 'I feel like this suits the challenge and is the kind of photo I was expecting to see. The zoom effect fools with my eyes and I enjoyed it enough to comment on it however the content could be more interesting.', '2012-03-30 01:23:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(6726626, 1006479, 117534, '<td valign="top">YES... This is the type of shots I expected to see and it is very cool!!! Great Job</td>', 'YES... This is the type of shots I expected to see and it is very cool!!! Great Job', '2012-03-30 01:24:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(6726627, 1006610, 114285, '<td valign="top">Lovely processing on this shot.</td>', 'Lovely processing on this shot.', '2012-03-30 01:24:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(6726628, 1007144, 37629, '<td valign="top">what interesting pastel colours and shapes. I don''t know what was around the rest of the image but a bit more of the surrounding would have been nice to see as the weird water shape is very central.</td>', 'what interesting pastel colours and shapes. I don''t know what was around the rest of the image but a bit more of the surrounding would have been nice to see as the weird water shape is very central.', '2012-03-30 01:25:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(6726629, 1007049, 114285, '<td valign="top">Lovely.</td>', 'Lovely.', '2012-03-30 01:26:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(6726632, 1007043, 37629, '<td valign="top">the huge amount of saturation adds to it and takes away from it at the same time. It looks like a candid but if that bag wasn''t there the narrative would be so strong, maybe through different cropping techniques. Cool shot though, caught at a great moment, which is a challenge with closed eyes. nice work.</td>', 'the huge amount of saturation adds to it and takes away from it at the same time. It looks like a candid but if that bag wasn''t there the narrative would be so strong, maybe through different cropping techniques. Cool shot though, caught at a great moment, which is a challenge with closed eyes. nice work.', '2012-03-30 01:27:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(6726634, 1007142, 37629, '<td valign="top">I like the movie-ish frame but I don''t like the additional white lines you have added, the black would have been sufficient. I wonder what they are looking at. A nice moment to capture with your eyes closed.</td>', 'I like the movie-ish frame but I don''t like the additional white lines you have added, the black would have been sufficient. I wonder what they are looking at. A nice moment to capture with your eyes closed.', '2012-03-30 01:28:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(6726635, 1006700, 114285, '<td valign="top">Warm glow to this, well done.</td>', 'Warm glow to this, well done.', '2012-03-30 01:28:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(6726636, 1006655, 37629, '<td valign="top">the angle works really well and I assume its a result of not using your eyes to level the shot. How lucky. Nice stuff.</td>', 'the angle works really well and I assume its a result of not using your eyes to level the shot. How lucky. Nice stuff.', '2012-03-30 01:28:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(6726637, 1006064, 37629, '<td valign="top">haha, I enjoy this photo a lot. It would make a nice computer desktop. It seems like a still from a movie where a character is entering a scene. a horror movie no doubt. interesting.</td>', 'haha, I enjoy this photo a lot. It would make a nice computer desktop. It seems like a still from a movie where a character is entering a scene. a horror movie no doubt. interesting.', '2012-03-30 01:30:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(6726638, 1006939, 37629, '<td valign="top">What a great narrative this shot has. What a great moment to capture, you pressed the shutter at just the right time. Are you sure your eyes were closed and you were snapping randomly? Must have been cause this sort of shot is the kind of gem you get when taking a hundred photos. Excellent.</td>', 'What a great narrative this shot has. What a great moment to capture, you pressed the shutter at just the right time. Are you sure your eyes were closed and you were snapping randomly? Must have been cause this sort of shot is the kind of gem you get when taking a hundred photos. Excellent.', '2012-03-30 01:31:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(6726639, 1006562, 54778, '<td valign="top">I really like the hand and the expression.</td>', 'I really like the hand and the expression.', '2012-03-30 01:32:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(6726640, 1006997, 37629, '<td valign="top">what I enjoy about this photo is that it makes me think you closed your eyes while driving on the freeway. photography isn''t worth killing yourself over!</td>', 'what I enjoy about this photo is that it makes me think you closed your eyes while driving on the freeway. photography isn''t worth killing yourself over!', '2012-03-30 01:32:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(6726643, 1006349, 100831, '<td valign="top">OMG this is gorgeous.</td>', 'OMG this is gorgeous.', '2012-03-30 01:33:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(6726645, 1006510, 37629, '<td valign="top">if only that bright bottom right hand corner could''ve been cropped out. the greens of the trees and the way those branches are reflected is so stunning. The red reflections in the branches should have either been hyper saturated to make them stand out, or blended far more. Almost a very nice shot but i love the tree in the middle.</td>', 'if only that bright bottom right hand corner could''ve been cropped out. the greens of the trees and the way those branches are reflected is so stunning. The red reflections in the branches should have either been hyper saturated to make them stand out, or blended far more. Almost a very nice shot but i love the tree in the middle.', '2012-03-30 01:34:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(6726647, 1006312, 37629, '<td valign="top">great expression and great narrative. I love the tones in the image as well as the composition. My favourite part by FAR is the little boys head in the bottom left hand corner. HAH, when i saw it I lost it. fantastic.</td>', 'great expression and great narrative. I love the tones in the image as well as the composition. My favourite part by FAR is the little boys head in the bottom left hand corner. HAH, when i saw it I lost it. fantastic.', '2012-03-30 01:35:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(6726649, 1006063, 49954, '<td valign="top">Did not vote on this one.</td>', 'Did not vote on this one.', '2012-03-30 01:37:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(6726651, 1005906, 37629, '<td valign="top">I really enjoy this shot, it reminds me of autumn or early winter and I can almost smell it. Eerily comforting and unsettling at the same time, dreamlike with the blurs of the photo. The image looks a bit flat and a greater range of tones would have been nice while playing with the levels but I enjoy this shot a lot.</td>', 'I really enjoy this shot, it reminds me of autumn or early winter and I can almost smell it. Eerily comforting and unsettling at the same time, dreamlike with the blurs of the photo. The image looks a bit flat and a greater range of tones would have been nice while playing with the levels but I enjoy this shot a lot.', '2012-03-30 01:37:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(6726653, 1007008, 49954, '<td valign="top">Believe your eyes were closed on this, but that you set up the tripod and slow shutter speed.  Closed your eyes and pressed the release.  Not scoring it because I could be wrong.</td>', 'Believe your eyes were closed on this, but that you set up the tripod and slow shutter speed.  Closed your eyes and pressed the release.  Not scoring it because I could be wrong.', '2012-03-30 01:37:55.000000', NULL, 1),
