(6726659, 1006491, 37629, '<td valign="top">I love this shot a lot. So mundane but so busy, I can''t stop looking at all of the little things. Great title as well, clever. The way it''s composed whether from being cropped or the accidental composition is fantastic, it keeps the business of the picture from becoming overwhelming. I like this a lot.</td>', 'I love this shot a lot. So mundane but so busy, I can''t stop looking at all of the little things. Great title as well, clever. The way it''s composed whether from being cropped or the accidental composition is fantastic, it keeps the business of the picture from becoming overwhelming. I like this a lot.', '2012-03-30 01:38:55.000000', NULL, 1),
