(6726675, 1006934, 37629, '<td valign="top">this photo really catches my eye. the bizarre white stone creature in the centre composes it nicely. the patterns in the glass are outstanding, it would be interesting to see a close up shot of just that. It''s really weird and fun to look at. nice.</td>', 'this photo really catches my eye. the bizarre white stone creature in the centre composes it nicely. the patterns in the glass are outstanding, it would be interesting to see a close up shot of just that. It''s really weird and fun to look at. nice.', '2012-03-30 01:42:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(6726679, 1006461, 37629, '<td valign="top">I want to know what happens next. This image like many in the challenge as I have noticed tells such a nice story, it seems really intense. the cropping worked greatly in your favour. I almost skipped past it until I saw the arm on the right and had to re-evaluate the whole thing. the motion blur is working very nicely swell. <br/> <br/>I hate the shirt and the watch though, or maybe just the shirt, a weird distraction but you can''t be to choosey with your eyes closed. nice shot!!</td>', 'I want to know what happens next. This image like many in the challenge as I have noticed tells such a nice story, it seems really intense. the cropping worked greatly in your favour. I almost skipped past it until I saw the arm on the right and had to re-evaluate the whole thing. the motion blur is working very nicely swell.  I hate the shirt and the watch though, or maybe just the shirt, a weird distraction but you can''t be to choosey with your eyes closed. nice shot!!', '2012-03-30 01:45:49.000000', NULL, 1),
