(6726966, 1006939, 15711, '<td valign="top">Really?  You had your eyes closed?  Terrific.  My fav so far.  I like how this image connects two people who might otherwise never have any relationship at all.  Great contrasts.</td>', 'Really?  You had your eyes closed?  Terrific.  My fav so far.  I like how this image connects two people who might otherwise never have any relationship at all.  Great contrasts.', '2012-03-30 09:57:42.000000', NULL, 1),
