(6726970, 1006562, 15711, '<td valign="top">I know that expression oh too well. LOL  A slice of life captured on your memory card.  I like it.  If I were looking at symbolism, the plug would certainly play a big part.</td>', 'I know that expression oh too well. LOL  A slice of life captured on your memory card.  I like it.  If I were looking at symbolism, the plug would certainly play a big part.', '2012-03-30 09:59:49.000000', NULL, 1),
