(6726979, 1006461, 15711, '<td valign="top">Oh this is great.  I feel the sense of movement. The reflection on the bracelet on the person''s wrist adds a nice touch.  One of my favs.  Great story we could interpret from this.</td>', 'Oh this is great.  I feel the sense of movement. The reflection on the bracelet on the person''s wrist adds a nice touch.  One of my favs.  Great story we could interpret from this.', '2012-03-30 10:03:01.000000', NULL, 1),
