(6726982, 1006909, 15711, '<td valign="top">Don''t you love that word?  Glad to know someone else uses it besides me. Do you say catty corner, or kitty corner?  I say the first one. ;)</td>', 'Don''t you love that word?  Glad to know someone else uses it besides me. Do you say catty corner, or kitty corner?  I say the first one. ;)', '2012-03-30 10:04:49.000000', NULL, 1),
