(6726986, 1007024, 15711, '<td valign="top">I like the unexpected linear quality of the drops going in a straight vertical line amidst the undulating water and curve of the swan. I like the deep rich tones too.  Nice one. One of my favs.</td>', 'I like the unexpected linear quality of the drops going in a straight vertical line amidst the undulating water and curve of the swan. I like the deep rich tones too.  Nice one. One of my favs.', '2012-03-30 10:06:44.000000', NULL, 1),
