(6726989, 1007077, 15711, '<td valign="top">I like it a lot.  The movement of the smoke.  It makes me wonder why he has bandana as a blindfold.  If he were about to be executed, he wouldn''t be wearing that zip up jacket, so it makes me ponder the story.</td>', 'I like it a lot.  The movement of the smoke.  It makes me wonder why he has bandana as a blindfold.  If he were about to be executed, he wouldn''t be wearing that zip up jacket, so it makes me ponder the story.', '2012-03-30 10:07:58.000000', NULL, 1),
