(6729834, 1007039, 134859, '<td valign="top">This is very different.  Not sure what the main subject is supposed to be.  Originally, I thought it was the switch plate for the light... then I thought maybe the reflection of the candles(?), and then the dark reflection/shadow of a person?  Not sure... which makes me look at it longer, to try and decide what I like and don''t like.  Very intriguing photo.</td>', 'This is very different.  Not sure what the main subject is supposed to be.  Originally, I thought it was the switch plate for the light... then I thought maybe the reflection of the candles(?), and then the dark reflection/shadow of a person?  Not sure... which makes me look at it longer, to try and decide what I like and don''t like.  Very intriguing photo.', '2012-04-02 14:04:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(6729836, 1006854, 134859, '<td valign="top">Nice close up.  Don''t think that it did this shot justice, because the eyelashes look clumped from mascara.  I do like the colors, but there is a "softness" that is lacking, IMO</td>', 'Nice close up.  Don''t think that it did this shot justice, because the eyelashes look clumped from mascara.  I do like the colors, but there is a "softness" that is lacking, IMO', '2012-04-02 14:04:49.000000', NULL, 1),
