(6733154, 1007008, 41129, '<td valign="top">Long exposure fair enough.. but with rocks still in perfect focus?, must have been on a tripod, and hence setup and aimed, i sincerely doubt your eyes were closed while you mounted the camera onto the tripod and decided where to point it (way too risky to equipment).. this has to be a setup shot as far as i''m concerned, either that or you have hands as steady as a stone statue lol. Kinda defeats the spirit of the challenge for me but I shall obviously vote the picture as it is and give you a 7</td>', 'Long exposure fair enough.. but with rocks still in perfect focus?, must have been on a tripod, and hence setup and aimed, i sincerely doubt your eyes were closed while you mounted the camera onto the tripod and decided where to point it (way too risky to equipment).. this has to be a setup shot as far as i''m concerned, either that or you have hands as steady as a stone statue lol. Kinda defeats the spirit of the challenge for me but I shall obviously vote the picture as it is and give you a 7', '2012-04-05 09:02:16.000000', NULL, 1),
