(6734254, 1006934, 116247, '<td valign="top">It was fun "guiding" you away from the poop... but it was tempting to let you go forward! I also enjoyed watching you hold your camera at your eyebrow. The one thing I can say for sure, you took the challenge to heart and there was never any doubt that you had your eyes closed. I am going to seach the security cameras at the museum! I am sure the videos would be a youtube hit!! <br/> <br/>Congrats on a great finish and I love the one you entered!<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2012-04-07 09:03:22.</i></td>', 'It was fun "guiding" you away from the poop... but it was tempting to let you go forward! I also enjoyed watching you hold your camera at your eyebrow. The one thing I can say for sure, you took the challenge to heart and there was never any doubt that you had your eyes closed. I am going to seach the security cameras at the museum! I am sure the videos would be a youtube hit!!  Congrats on a great finish and I love the one you entered!', '2012-04-06 11:38:45.000000', '2012-04-07 10:03:22.000000', 0),
